        `the position of the item in the printed order` IS 8
        `what the item asks for` IS "the number of approvals under regulation 26 which were not valid, or ceased to be valid under paragraph (9) of that regulation"
        `the kind of information` IS `sch 4 a number`
        `of whom the item is asked` IS `sch 4 every supervisory authority`
        `the limbs of the item` IS LIST


-- src:3225 | In the case of a self-regulatory organisation, the number, amount and type of disciplinary measures it has imposed in relation to contraventions of these Regulations on supervised persons.
@ref sch 4 item 9 (src:3225)
GIVETH A `sch 4 item`
`sch 4 item 9` MEANS
    `sch 4 item` WITH
        `the position of the item in the printed order` IS 9
        `what the item asks for` IS "in the case of a self-regulatory organisation, the number, amount and type of disciplinary measures it has imposed in relation to contraventions of these Regulations on supervised persons"
        `the kind of information` IS `sch 4 a number, an amount and a type`
        `of whom the item is asked` IS `sch 4 a self-regulatory organisation only`
        `the limbs of the item` IS LIST


-- src:3226 | The number of times the supervisory authority has—
-- src:3227 | (a) refused to register an applicant for registration under regulation 59; or
-- src:3228 | (b) exercised any powers under regulation 60.
@ref sch 4 item 10 (src:3226-3228)
GIVETH A `sch 4 item`
`sch 4 item 10` MEANS
    `sch 4 item` WITH
        `the position of the item in the printed order` IS 10
        `what the item asks for` IS "the number of times the supervisory authority has refused to register an applicant under regulation 59 or exercised any powers under regulation 60"
        `the kind of information` IS `sch 4 a number`
        `of whom the item is asked` IS `sch 4 every supervisory authority`
        `the limbs of the item` IS LIST
            "refused to register an applicant for registration under regulation 59"
          , "exercised any powers under regulation 60"


-- src:3229 | The number of times the supervisory authority has exercised any powers under Part 8.
@ref sch 4 item 11 (src:3229)
GIVETH A `sch 4 item`
`sch 4 item 11` MEANS
    `sch 4 item` WITH
        `the position of the item in the printed order` IS 11
        `what the item asks for` IS "the number of times the supervisory authority has exercised any powers under Part 8"
        `the kind of information` IS `sch 4 a number`
        `of whom the item is asked` IS `sch 4 every supervisory authority`
        `the limbs of the item` IS LIST


-- src:3230 | The number of contraventions of these Regulations committed by supervised persons.
@ref sch 4 item 12 (src:3230)
GIVETH A `sch 4 item`
`sch 4 item 12` MEANS
    `sch 4 item` WITH
        `the position of the item in the printed order` IS 12
        `what the item asks for` IS "the number of contraventions of these Regulations committed by supervised persons"
        `the kind of information` IS `sch 4 a number`
        `of whom the item is asked` IS `sch 4 every supervisory authority`
        `the limbs of the item` IS LIST


-- src:3231 | The number of contraventions of these Regulations identified upon exercise of the powers under Part 8.
@ref sch 4 item 13 (src:3231)
GIVETH A `sch 4 item`
`sch 4 item 13` MEANS
    `sch 4 item` WITH
        `the position of the item in the printed order` IS 13
        `what the item asks for` IS "the number of contraventions of these Regulations identified upon exercise of the powers under Part 8"
        `the kind of information` IS `sch 4 a number`
        `of whom the item is asked` IS `sch 4 every supervisory authority`
        `the limbs of the item` IS LIST


-- src:3232 | The number and amount of penalties or charges which have been imposed under Part 9.
@ref sch 4 item 14 (src:3232)
GIVETH A `sch 4 item`
`sch 4 item 14` MEANS
    `sch 4 item` WITH
        `the position of the item in the printed order` IS 14
        `what the item asks for` IS "the number and amount of penalties or charges which have been imposed under Part 9"
        `the kind of information` IS `sch 4 a number and an amount`
        `of whom the item is asked` IS `sch 4 every supervisory authority`
        `the limbs of the item` IS LIST


-- src:3233 | The number of times the supervisory authority has exercised the other powers under Part 9.
@ref sch 4 item 15 (src:3233)
GIVETH A `sch 4 item`
`sch 4 item 15` MEANS
    `sch 4 item` WITH
        `the position of the item in the printed order` IS 15
        `what the item asks for` IS "the number of times the supervisory authority has exercised the other powers under Part 9"
        `the kind of information` IS `sch 4 a number`
        `of whom the item is asked` IS `sch 4 every supervisory authority`
        `the limbs of the item` IS LIST


-- src:3234 | The number of times the supervisory authority or any of its supervised persons has made a suspicious activity disclosure to the NCA, and for these purposes, “suspicious activity disclosure” has the meaning given in regulation 104(4).
@ref sch 4 item 16 (src:3234)
GIVETH A `sch 4 item`
`sch 4 item 16` MEANS
    `sch 4 item` WITH
        `the position of the item in the printed order` IS 16
        `what the item asks for` IS "the number of times the supervisory authority or any of its supervised persons has made a suspicious activity disclosure to the NCA"
        `the kind of information` IS `sch 4 a number`
        `of whom the item is asked` IS `sch 4 every supervisory authority`
        `the limbs of the item` IS LIST

-- "suspicious activity disclosure" has the meaning given in regulation 104(4) of these Regulations (encoded by part mlr4).  A pointer.
@ref sch 4 item 16 (src:3234)
GIVETH A STRING
`sch 4 item 16 suspicious activity disclosure has the meaning given in` MEANS "regulation 104(4)"

-- src:3235 | A copy of any suspicious activity disclosure (within the meaning given in regulation 104(4)) the supervisory authority or any of its supervised persons has made to the NCA.
@ref sch 4 item 17 (src:3235)
GIVETH A `sch 4 item`
`sch 4 item 17` MEANS
    `sch 4 item` WITH
        `the position of the item in the printed order` IS 17
        `what the item asks for` IS "a copy of any suspicious activity disclosure the supervisory authority or any of its supervised persons has made to the NCA"
        `the kind of information` IS `sch 4 a copy`
        `of whom the item is asked` IS `sch 4 every supervisory authority`
        `the limbs of the item` IS LIST


-- src:3236 | The number of supervised persons who have contravened requirements imposed by or under—
-- src:3237 | (a) Part 3 of the Terrorism Act 2000 (terrorist property) , or
-- src:3238 | (b) Part 7 (money laundering) or 8 (investigations) of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002 .
@ref sch 4 item 18 (src:3236-3238)
GIVETH A `sch 4 item`
`sch 4 item 18` MEANS
    `sch 4 item` WITH
        `the position of the item in the printed order` IS 18
        `what the item asks for` IS "the number of supervised persons who have contravened requirements imposed by or under Part 3 of the Terrorism Act 2000 or Part 7 or 8 of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002"
        `the kind of information` IS `sch 4 a number`
        `of whom the item is asked` IS `sch 4 every supervisory authority`
        `the limbs of the item` IS LIST
            "Part 3 of the Terrorism Act 2000 (terrorist property)"
          , "Part 7 (money laundering) or 8 (investigations) of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002"


-- src:3239 | Information on the money laundering and terrorist financing practices that the supervisory authority considers apply to its own sector.
@ref sch 4 item 19 (src:3239)
GIVETH A `sch 4 item`
`sch 4 item 19` MEANS
    `sch 4 item` WITH
        `the position of the item in the printed order` IS 19
        `what the item asks for` IS "information on the money laundering and terrorist financing practices that the supervisory authority considers apply to its own sector"
        `the kind of information` IS `sch 4 a description`
        `of whom the item is asked` IS `sch 4 every supervisory authority`
        `the limbs of the item` IS LIST


-- src:3240 | Indications that the supervisory authority considers to suggest that a transfer of criminal funds takes place in their own sector.
@ref sch 4 item 20 (src:3240)
GIVETH A `sch 4 item`
`sch 4 item 20` MEANS
    `sch 4 item` WITH
        `the position of the item in the printed order` IS 20
        `what the item asks for` IS "indications that the supervisory authority considers to suggest that a transfer of criminal funds takes place in their own sector"
        `the kind of information` IS `sch 4 an indication`
        `of whom the item is asked` IS `sch 4 every supervisory authority`
        `the limbs of the item` IS LIST


-- src:3241 | The amount of human resource allocated by the supervisory authority to supervising the countering of money laundering and terrorist financing.
@ref sch 4 item 21 (src:3241)
GIVETH A `sch 4 item`
`sch 4 item 21` MEANS
    `sch 4 item` WITH
        `the position of the item in the printed order` IS 21
        `what the item asks for` IS "the amount of human resource allocated by the supervisory authority to supervising the countering of money laundering and terrorist financing"
        `the kind of information` IS `sch 4 an amount of human resource`
        `of whom the item is asked` IS `sch 4 every supervisory authority`
        `the limbs of the item` IS LIST


-- The table: all twenty-one items, in the printed order.
@ref sch 4 (items 1 to 21 together)
GIVETH A LIST OF `sch 4 item`
`sch 4 the items` MEANS
    LIST
        `sch 4 item 1`
      , `sch 4 item 2`
      , `sch 4 item 3`
      , `sch 4 item 4`
      , `sch 4 item 5`
      , `sch 4 item 6`
      , `sch 4 item 7`
      , `sch 4 item 8`
      , `sch 4 item 9`
      , `sch 4 item 10`
      , `sch 4 item 11`
      , `sch 4 item 12`
      , `sch 4 item 13`
      , `sch 4 item 14`
      , `sch 4 item 15`
      , `sch 4 item 16`
      , `sch 4 item 17`
      , `sch 4 item 18`
      , `sch 4 item 19`
      , `sch 4 item 20`
      , `sch 4 item 21`

-- Which items a supervisory authority is asked for: every item for a self-regulatory organisation; every item not limited to a
-- self-regulatory organisation for any other authority.
@ref sch 4 (items 1 to 21 together)
GIVEN `the supervisory authority is a self-regulatory organisation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
`sch 4 the items asked of the supervisory authority` MEANS
    map (GIVEN i YIELD i's `the position of the item in the printed order`)
        (filter (GIVEN i YIELD     `the supervisory authority is a self-regulatory organisation`
                                OR (NOT (i's `of whom the item is asked` EQUALS `sch 4 a self-regulatory organisation only`)))
                `sch 4 the items`)

-- One item, asked of one authority.
@ref sch 4 (items 1 to 21 together)
GIVEN `the position of the item in the printed order` IS A NUMBER
      `the supervisory authority is a self-regulatory organisation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 4 the item is asked of the supervisory authority` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF any (GIVEN i YIELD     i's `the position of the item in the printed order` EQUALS `the position of the item in the printed order`
                              AND i's `of whom the item is asked` EQUALS `sch 4 every supervisory authority`) `sch 4 the items`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        IF     `the supervisory authority is a self-regulatory organisation`
           AND any (GIVEN i YIELD     i's `the position of the item in the printed order` EQUALS `the position of the item in the printed order`
                                  AND i's `of whom the item is asked` EQUALS `sch 4 a self-regulatory organisation only`) `sch 4 the items`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): an item that begins "In the case of a self-regulatory organisation" says nothing of another authority; and the Schedule has no item at a position outside 1 to 21

